WEBVTT - Ghostline Launch & Feature Overview

00:00.500 --> 00:07.500
Ghostline: Native Windows Assistive AI & Meeting Copilot.

00:08.000 --> 00:17.500
Designed in Microsoft Fluent 2 Dark for Windows 10 & 11 with fast, lightweight desktop performance.

00:18.000 --> 00:27.500
3-Step Setup: Download the installer or portable zip, choose your AI provider, and start with global hotkeys.

00:28.000 --> 00:39.500
Screen Solve: Press Alt + / to instantly solve questions under your cursor, or Alt + Shift + / for full screen.

00:40.000 --> 00:51.500
Live Audio Copilot: Press Alt + A for real-time meeting transcription with dual-stream speaker attribution.

00:52.000 --> 01:03.500
Profile Grounding: Ground answers in your genuine resume and experience, eliminating generic AI hallucinations.

01:04.000 --> 01:15.500
Privacy & Boundaries: Run 100% offline with Ollama, or connect cloud providers with DPAPI-encrypted keys.

01:16.000 --> 01:25.500
System Tray: Runs unobtrusively in your notification area with quick controls, diagnostics, and background stealth.

01:26.000 --> 01:35.500
Interactive Web Sandbox: Try every feature in your browser before downloading at our official documentation site.

01:36.000 --> 01:44.000
Ethical Use: Follow the rules of your school, employer or interviewer. Download free on GitHub.
